          "index": 0,
          "old": "So, here's the tea on Reuben's family, Israel's oldest son. Even though Reuben was the firstborn, he totally blew it by hooking up with his own dad's side-chick. Super messed up, right? So, his firstborn rights got handed over to Joseph's sons. He basically got demoted from being the #1 kid in the family tree. And get this, even though Judah's family line became the most powerful and King David came from them, the official 'firstborn' title still went to Joseph's kids.",
          "new": "So, here's the tea on Reuben's family, Israel's oldest son. Even though Reuben was the firstborn, he totally blew it by hooking up with his dad's concubine. Super messed up, right? So, his firstborn rights got handed over to Joseph's sons. He basically got demoted from being the #1 kid in the family tree. And get this, even though Judah's family line became the most powerful and King David came from them, the official 'firstborn' title still went to Joseph's kids.",
